  and selected sender/DecayAverage test assertions.
- transport.rs, buffers.rs, async_runtime.rs and proto/sf_v1.proto: selected
  ReplicationTransport/endpoint/header/message and timer-lifetime contracts,
  adapted to bounded Rust queues, explicit buffer framing and Tokio/tonic.
- replication_queue_manager.rs, replica_manager.rs, primary.rs and policy:
  primary queue/quorum/configuration/catch-up/pressure/slow-peer/Close ownership
  and selected ReplicaManager assertions.
- received_operation.rs, operation_stream.rs, secondary_receiver.rs,
  secondary_copy_receiver.rs, copy_context_receiver.rs and secondary.rs:
  ComFromBytesOperation/OperationStream/secondary receiver and lifecycle
  responsibilities and selected ReplicationSecondary/ReplicateCopyOperations
  expectations.
- copy_async_operation.rs, copy_sender.rs, copy_establishment.rs and
  build_idle.rs: selected enumeration, target-context acquisition, StartCopy,
  build/retarget/cancellation and provider-lifetime contracts, including
  selected CopyAsyncOperation test expectations.
- role.rs, ingress.rs and secondary/ingress.rs: ReplicatorState, role/epoch,
  data-loss, Open/restart, routing and direct lifecycle responsibilities,
  including selected PublicApi data-loss expectations.
- service_adapter.rs and service_adapter/facade.rs: protected trait/service
